            description: "Hardy in Zone 2. Very hardy and sturdy. Parentage is a cross of the Haralson and Rescue varieties. Orange striped yellow apple, 7 centimeters in diameter. May produce fruit a year earlier than other varieties. Taste is similar to an apple-pear and often compared to the Golden Delicious. Fruit is good for both eating and cooking. May store for approximately three months"
        },
        {
